{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26981","headline":"喜胡遇至 · 姚合","name":"喜胡遇至","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"穷居稀出入，门户满尘埃。\n病少闲人问，贫唯密友来。\n茅斋从埽破，药酒遣生开。\n多事经时别，还愁不宿回。\n就林烧嫩笋，遶树拣香梅。\n相对题新什，迟成举罚杯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}